.braindump-scratch/
PLAN.md

# Local machine config
local.properties
.idea/
*.iml

# Gradle build output. These are anchored deliberately: a bare `build/` pattern also
# matches any Kotlin package directory named `build`, which silently untracks source.
.gradle/
.kotlin/
/build/
/build-logic/build/
/demo/build/
/benchmark/build/
/superplayer-*/build/

# Device measurement runs: traces, reports and run metadata. See devicelab/README.md.
/devicelab/out/

# Benchmark runs that are not the committed baseline. `benchmark/baseline/` is tracked on purpose —
# it is what Phase 3 is graded against, and a baseline nobody can find is not one. See
# benchmark/README.md.
/benchmark/out/

# The Swift package (Package.swift, ios/). SwiftPM writes .build/ and .swiftpm/ beside the manifest,
# which is the repository root; ios/check keeps xcodebuild's DerivedData under .build/ as well, and
# the last pattern catches an Xcode that was pointed somewhere of its own.
/.build/
/.swiftpm/
DerivedData/

# The iOS demo's per-user Xcode state; its project, workspace and shared scheme are tracked.
xcuserdata/
